          "imagePrompt": "Premium glossy 3D achievement emblem, first tier of an unbroken-connection series. One oversized closed climbing carabiner is the hero, tilted diagonally with its secure gate clearly visible. Thick polished turquoise metal surrounds a translucent sapphire glass inset along the spine. A chunky shield-shaped beveled metal frame carries one continuous recessed blue enamel ribbon around its border. Rare turquoise and sapphire palette, tiny stars and sparks at the gate, saturated cinematic rim light, dark navy studio background, soft contact shadow, readable at 96px. No text, letters, numbers, inscriptions, logos, people, bodies, or user photographs.",
