          "imagePrompt": "Premium glossy 3D achievement emblem, culminating tier of an unbroken-connection series. One miniature suspension bridge is the monumental hero, with thick turquoise metal towers, bold simplified cables and an uninterrupted translucent sapphire glass deck. Show it in a dramatic three-quarter view with no surrounding landscape, vehicles or road markings. A broad triple-beveled shield-shaped metal frame surrounds it with a continuous luminous blue enamel ribbon. Rare turquoise and sapphire palette, majestic layered depth, tiny stars and sparks, saturated cinematic rim light, dark navy studio background, soft contact shadow, readable at 96px. No text, letters, numbers, inscriptions, logos, people, bodies, or user photographs.",
